<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-Z NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-Z NOV NET RISES TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.76 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.97 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.15 vs   0.09 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   15.61 vs  13.22</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.34 vs   6.80</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.64 vs   7.72</p>
<p> Operating profit    12.40 vs   6.16</p>
<p> Sales		  184.61 vs 125.23</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Mostostal Zabrze SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
